QuestGuidance.Register("es",277,{
[8833]="70058C7E\n1\tReclama el primer campamento para Erebor\tEl enemigo controla este lugar. Deberías reclamar esta zona para Erebor.\n2\tReclama el segundo campamento para Erebor\tEl enemigo controla este lugar. Deberías reclamar esta zona para Erebor.\n3\tReclama el tercer campamento para Erebor\tEl enemigo controla este lugar. Deberías reclamar esta zona para Erebor.\n4\tReclama el campamento final para Erebor\tEl enemigo controla este lugar. Deberías reclamar esta zona para Erebor.\n",
[8834]="70057F09\n1\tColoca estandartes a medida que reclamas Bizar-atrâd (total: 4)\tReclama Bizar-atrâd.\n",
[8835]="70057F4C\n1\tComplete Mission: Reclaiming the Vale-watch\tYour mission is to reclaim Bizar-atrâd. Speak to Hórin to travel to Bizar-atrâd.\n2\tHabla con Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8836]="7006C132\n1\tComplete Mission: Recovering the Past\tYour mission is to travel to Dûl Zidur and secure precious historical artifacts and scrolls before the Barkhûshim can destroy them. Speak to Udlanu to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Udlanu in Urmâkh\tYou have recovered the artifacts! Return with the scout to Udlanu in Urmâkh with this report.\n",
[8837]="7005BDED\n1\tDerrota a los sombríos de escarcha (total: 6)\030Repara las forjas (total: 8)\030Derrota a los Dragonzuelos fríos (total: 6)\tDebes reparar las forjas mientras combates a los sombríos y Dragonzuelos fríos\n2\tRegresa a la entrada de la forja\tRegresa a la entrada de la forja.\n",
[8838]="7005BDEE\n1\tComplete Mission: Reforging the Future\tYour mission is to repair several forges and secure the area. Speak to Hórin to travel to the forge.\n2\tHabla con Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8839]="700582E0\n1\tRecupera alijos de los enanos en Kidzul-kâlah (total: 12)\tSe te ha encomendado la tarea de recuperar alijos de los enanos en Kidzul-kâlah antes de que los Duramano puedan reclamarlos.\n",
[8840]="700582E5\n1\tCompleta 'Miniaventura: Reliquias de la Fisura Dorada'\tYour mission is to recover dwarf-caches from Kidzul-kâlah before the Dourhands can lay claim to them. You should talk to Ausma and travel to Kidzul-kâlah.\n2\tHabla con Ausma\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Ausma for your reward.\n",
[8841]="7006D1C9\n1\tComplete Mission: Rescue at Gha Nêkha\tYour mission is to help the people of Gha Nêkha by forcibly removing the Ordâkhai soldiers there. Talk to Khâdamul when you are ready to travel to Gha Nêkha.\n2\tSpeak with Khâdamul in Iridír\tYou have saved the people of Gha Nêkha! Return with the Dumûri scout to report your success.\n",
[8842]="7006E4D3\n1\tCompleta la miniaventura: Rescate a la luz de la luna\tSe te ha pedido que rescates a Avorthal, el príncipe de los Elfos de Celondim, de las garras de los Duramano. Cuando estés en la ciudad portuaria de Kheledûl, también deberás recuperar las cajas que contienen los tesoros que los Duramano han robado a los Barbiluengos.\n2\tHabla con el extraño encapuchado en el Poney Pisador\tHas rescatado con éxito a Avorthal y recuperado las cajas con los tesoros robados por los Duramano a los Barbiluengos.\n",
[8843]="7005984C\n1\tAyuda a los enanos de los Gabil'akkâ a superar sus pensamientos de desesperación (total: 8)\tTu misión es levantar los ánimos de los soldados desanimados de los Gabil'akkâ en Zarkul-sulûn y ayudarles a superar sus pensamientos de desesperación.\n",
[8844]="7005984D\n1\tCompleta 'Miniaventura: Reposo en Zarkul-sulûn'\tYour mission is to raise the spirits of disheartened soldiers of the Gabil'akkâ at Zarkul-sulûn and help them to overcome thoughts of despair. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath and travel to Zarkul-sulûn.\n2\tTalk to Vorthur Smokebreath\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath at Akrâz-zahar.\n",
[8845]="7005A824\n1\tDestruye los obeliscos rituales (total: 6)\030Derrota a los espíritus malvados (total: 12)\tDebes interrumpir el ritual Angmarim en Dûn Traikh.\n2\tReagrúpate cerca de la puerta norte de Dûn Traikh\tDeberías reagruparte cerca de la puerta norte de Dûn Traikh.\n",
[8846]="7005A832\n1\tComplete Mission: Ritual of Sacrifice\tYour mission is to destroy the Angmarim ritual at Dûn Traikh. Speak to Ausma to travel to Dûn Traikh.\n2\tHabla con Ausma\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Ausma for your reward!\n",
[8847]="70072E9F\n1\tComplete Mission: Robbers on the Road\tYour mission is to go eastward on the road to Zajâna and see to the safety of a trade caravan travelling that road. Talk to Têsegi when you are ready to travel.\n2\tTalk to Têsegi Jiret-menêsh\tYou have completed your mission of ensuring the safety of the caravan. Return with the Temámir scout to report your success.\n",
[8848]="70072F85\n1\tComplete Mission: Routing Reinforcements\tYour mission is to enter into the guard barracks, destroy any of the barricades found within, and defeat their captain.\n2\tSpeak with Shâpar in Ahaba\tYou have secured the needed weapons for our resistance.\n",
[8849]="70070CD5\n1\tComplete Mission: Sampling the Bog-lurkers\tYour mission is to travel to Lhámuth and gather Pale Blight samples from the bog-lurkers there for the scholars of Sul Madásh. Speak to Várudar to travel.\n2\tReturn to Várudar in Sul Madásh\tYou have successfully gathered Pale Blight samples from the bog-lurkers in Lhámuth. Bring them to the scholars of Sul Madásh for them to study.\n",
[8850]="7005871A\n1\tRecupera restos de enanos de la despensa de Scatha (total: 6)\tTu misión es recuperar los restos saqueados de los enanos que encontraron su final en la despensa de Scatha.\n",
[8851]="7005871D\n1\tCompleta 'Miniaventura: El legado de Scatha'\tYour mission is to recover the scavenged remains of dwarves that met their ends in Scatha's Larder. You should talk to Ausma and travel to Scatha's Larder.\n2\tHabla con Ausma\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Ausma for your reward.\n",
[8852]="7006C508\n1\tComplete Mission: Scavengers of Our Fallen\tYour mission is to travel to Khazâda and thin the numbers of jackals in the area as well as burn the corpses of slain travellers that have been defiled by the beasts. Speak with Raphûz to travel.\n2\tHabla con Raphûz\tYou have successfully slain jackals and burned the remains in Khazâda! Return with the scout to Raphûz with this report.\n",
[8853]="70062FBB\n1\tRecoge planes (total: 3)\030Derrota a los bandidos en el campamento (total: 12)\t\n2\tEncuentra y habla con el explorador\t\n",
[8854]="7006302C\n1\tCompleta la Miniaventura: Secretos y planes\tLos hombres del sur representan una gran amenaza para la población, y muy especialmente, para Musgovilla. Se te ha encomendado que te infiltres en su campamento en busca de cualquier plan secreto que puedan estar tramando.\n2\tHabla con Irvo Curch\tHas recuperado los planes y se los has entregado al explorador que llegó para guiarte fuera del campamento. Ahora debes regresar con quien te confió la misión en Musgovilla para informarle de lo que has descubierto.\n",
[8855]="70057EB1\n1\tComplete Mission: Secrets of the Frostdelf\tYour mission is to mine the Frostdelf. Speak to Hórin to travel to the Frostdelf.\n2\tHabla con Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8856]="70057EBE\n1\tExtrae mineral en la Caverna Helada (total: 12)\tExtrae mineral en la Caverna Helada.\n2\tInvestiga el ruido proveniente de las profundidades de Akhatâr\t\n",
[8857]="7006C12F\n1\tComplete Mission: Securing Kûr Anzar\tThe Barkhûshim are attacking Kûr Anzar! Your mission is to destroy their makeshift fortifications and repel them from the lower ward of Kûr Anzar. Speak to Udlanu to travel.\n2\tSpeak with Udlanu in Urmâkh\tYou have successfully repelled the assault by the vile Barkhûshim! Return with the scout to Udlanu in Urmâkh with this report.\n",
[8858]="7006A327\n1\tComplete Mission: Securing Salvage\tA ship carrying weapons and supplies has been destroyed on the rocks in the Shield Isles and the cargo is washing ashore. Collect the salvageable supplies to keep them out of the hands of the Heirs of Castamir. Speak to Malthak to travel.\n2\tTalk to Malthak\tYou have collected the salvageable supplies and dealt with the Heirs of Castamir. Return to Malthak in the Bloody Eagle Tavern to report your success.\n",
[8859]="7005984F\n1\tAsegura el primer campamento en el Paso del Cuerno Rojo\tTu misión es asegurar el Paso del Cuerno Rojo.\n2\tAsegura el segundo campamento en el Paso del Cuerno Rojo\tTu misión es asegurar el Paso del Cuerno Rojo.\n3\tAsegura el tercer campamento en el Paso del Cuerno Rojo\tTu misión es asegurar el Paso del Cuerno Rojo.\n4\tAsegura el último campamento en el Paso del Cuerno Rojo\tTu misión es asegurar el Paso del Cuerno Rojo.\n",
[8860]="70059857\n1\tCompleta 'Miniaventura: Asegurando el Cuerno Rojo'\tYour mission is to secure the Redhorn Pass. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath and travel to the Dimrill Dale.\n2\tTalk to Vorthur Smokebreath\tYou have completed your mission. You should talk to Vorthur Smokebreath at Akrâz-zahar.\n",
[8861]="7005A81C\n1\tComplete Mission: Servants of Throkhâr\tYour mission is to defeat the Servants of Throkhâr and destroy their nameless shrines deep within Gundabad. Speak to Hórin to travel.\n2\tHabla con Hórin\tThe mission is complete! Speak to Hórin for your reward!\n",
[8862]="7005A82B\n1\tDestruye santuarios sin nombre (total: 10)\030Debes derrotar a los sirvientes de Throkhâr (total: 10)\tDebes derrotar a los sirvientes de Throkhâr y destruir sus santuarios sin nombre.\n2\tDerrota a Uknad, La que alimenta\tDebes derrotar a Uknad, La que alimenta.\n",
[8863]="70062D4F\n1\tCompleta la Miniaventura: Sombras en el Aguagrís\tHabla con quien te dio la misión e infórmale de que estás listo para investigar las ruinas a orillas del Aguagrís\n2\tRegresa con Hithriel e infórmale de tus hallazgos\tHas completado tu misión en las ruinas con éxito, deberías volver con quien te la encargó e infórmale de tus hallazgos.\n",
[8864]="70062D51\n1\tInvestiga a lo largo de las riberas del Aguagrís\tInvestiga las apariciones a lo largo de la ribera del Aguagrís.\n2\tAcércate al explorador para regresar al campamento\tAcércate al explorador para regresar al campamento.\n",
